## Tested versions\n\nThis error occurs on the Steam version of Godot and, specifically as far as I can tell, just the Windows versions.  Reported on Windows 10 and 11.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 / 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe SDK files (steam_api64.dll and steam_api.dll) shipped with the Windows versions of Godot on Steam seems to be outdated and causes issues with loading plug-ins like GodotSteam.  This does not occur in the non-Steam versions as those files do not exist.  However, updating them may cause older versions of said plug-ins to also fail due to compatibility problems so I'm not entirely sure what the best course of action is in this case.\n\nNeither Linux nor Mac versions seem to have any SDK files shipped with them so this is isolated purely to Windows.\n\nWe found a similar problem with companion add-ons like ExpressoBits SMP using older SDK files and Godot somehow exporting the older one instead of the newer one which causes loading issues.\n\nThis is, as far as it has been reported, a relatively new problem.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Install Godot through Steam\n- Install latest GodotSteam version\n- Plug-in will complain about not being loaded\n- Fixed by replacing the Steam SDK files shipped with Godot to latest SDK 1.63 or whatever the plug-in is currently using.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNone needed.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscr